TITLE  ARGUS corpus: tac (fotones)
       .
SKPAR  2              [Primary particles: 1=e-, 2=ph, 3=e+, 4=h, 5=a]
SENERG 1.25e6          [Initial energy (monoenergetic sources only)]
SPOSIT 0 0 -10                             [Coordinates of the source]
SCONE  0 0 5                           [Conical beam; angles in deg]
       .
MFNAME water.mat                      [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e4 1e3 1e4 0.05 0.05 1e4 1e3       [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MSIMPH 1e5 1e5 1e5 0.05 0.05 1e4          [EABSH(1:3),C1H,C2H,WCCH]
MSIMPN 1.0 500                                         [FNABS,FORCEN]
MFNAME hueso.mat                      [Material file, up to 20 chars]
MSIMPA 1e4 1e3 1e4 0.05 0.05 1e4 1e3       [EABS(1:3),C1,C2,WCC,WCR]
MSIMPH 1e5 1e5 1e5 0.05 0.05 1e4          [EABSH(1:3),C1H,C2H,WCCH]
MSIMPN 1.0 500                                         [FNABS,FORCEN]
       .
GEOMFN tac.geo                       [Geometry file, up to 20 chars]
       .
NBE    0 0 100                       [Energy window and no. of bins]
NBANGL 30 1               [No. of bins for the angles THETA and PHI]
       .
NSIMSH 2e4                     [Desired number of simulated showers]
TIME   2e9                         [Allotted simulation time, in sec]
